{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Qn8okj8Go31795214619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>雖然AI人工智能股份持續被拋售，但據報資產管理公司KKR &amp; Co.旗下的AI投資平台，仍計劃以最多100億美元估值，收購經營數據中心的EdgeCore Digital Infrastructure。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，KKR旗下的Helix Digital Infrastructure，擬以估值80億至100億美元收購EdgeCore，雙方談判仍在進行，或最終未能達成協議。Helix的投資者還包括輝達及科威特投資局等。而據EdgeCore網頁資料，公司在美國6個地區經營數據中心，容量合計超過2.27吉瓦。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:56:07.356418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:33:51.423157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:22.951111+00:00","content_hash":"9f37e38f7ddfe0f908c69fd75dd47a9b49ac5fb192a41038096c0d9dcd9ca46b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:56:07.356418+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}